INFO  2026-04-21T12:41:08 +0ms service=decision-log taskID=tsk_db00c15330018H6SEwGjekcx1M key=export_manifest value=## Producer and consumer map for shared contracts
- gol_db00e7baf002D66JShqFpChqWi exports the core shared DTOs from `src/types.ts` and the re-export hub from `src/contracts.ts`; consumed by every other backend, frontend, and test goal.
- gol_db00e7baf003fRwAjg4yNg9k4X exports `StockRow`, `PriceBar`, `initDatabase()`, `seedMarketData()`, and `advanceMarketTick()` from `src/db.ts` and `src/simulator.ts`; consumed by auth, market, trading, portfolio, history, and entry integration goals.
- gol_db00e7baf004hEGlnGKlaEAkkK exports auth and market routers plus auth/query helpers from `src/auth.ts` and `src/market.ts`; consumed by trading, portfolio, history, entry integration, and API tests.
- gol_db00e7baf005Ld03ut2zNjd7sJ exports trading, portfolio, history, and risk helpers from `src/trading.ts`, `src/portfolio.ts`, `src/history.ts`, `src/risk.ts`; consumed by entry integration and API tests.
- gol_db00e7baf006dvBBYi8D97aQVJ exports the app shell and theme tokens from `web/src/App.tsx`, `web/src/main.tsx`, and `web/src/styles/theme.css`; consumed by all web page goals.
- gol_db00e7baf007GIkpI1HmORz66u exports shared UI primitives from `web/src/components/shared/*`; consumed by all web page goals.
- gol_db00e7baf008BwgtySr7nLO73d exports market and trade pages from `web/src/pages/*` and related components; consumed by the web shell and entry integration.
- gol_db00e7baf009yRxd6guKNpCwoB exports portfolio and history pages from `web/src/pages/*`; consumed by the web shell and entry integration.
- gol_db00e7baf00bzTlAVuTR7RIBHG exports login and register pages from `web/src/pages/*` and auth client helpers from `web/src/api.ts`; consumed by the web shell and entry integration.
- gol_db00e7baf00co5ai6BbWmXW5ZK exports news-specific UI from `web/src/components/market/*` and `web/src/components/trading/*`; consumed by the market and trade page goals.
- gol_db00e7baf00dxRmH412MFtNqGv exports the server entry integration from `index.ts`; consumed by all backend route goals and the test suite.
